Breaking Down a Large Function into Smaller Pieces
=====================================================

When a function grows too large, it's a sign that it needs refactoring. Here are some techniques to help you break it down into more manageable pieces.

### 1. Extract Functions

Identify sections of the code that perform distinct tasks. Extract these into separate functions.

