    #...

def calculate_and_log_result():
    value = calculate_value()
    result = process_result(value)
    log_result(result)
    return result
```

### 2. Use Function Names to Describe Behavior

Use clear, descriptive names for your functions. This makes it easier for others (and yourself) to understand what each piece does.

